OL,3,GNEWSAPrimary pupils 'not fully
OL,4,Aprepared' for high school
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany pupils at a primary school are not
OL,7,Fbeing "fully prepared for the next
OL,8,Fstage of their education", inspectors
OL,9,Fhave found.
OL,11,FEducation watchdog Ofsted said aspects
OL,12,Fincluding achievement, curriculum,
OL,13,Fteaching, early years and inclusion at
OL,14,FWoodlands Primary School in Birkenhead,
OL,15,FWirral, "need attention" but it praised
OL,16,Fwork the school had done to try and
OL,17,Fimprove things.
OL,19,FOfsted no longer uses a one or two-word
OL,20,Fgrading system and instead ranks
OL,21,Fschools using a report card system.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,407,400,260,160,0,100
