OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAPrimary pupils 'not fully
OL,4,Aprepared' for high school
OL,5,
OL,6,FHead teacher, Gemma Crosthwaite said
OL,7,Fthe areas highlighted for improvement
OL,8,Fwere "already priorities within our
OL,9,Fschool improvement plans" but she was
OL,10,Fpleased inspectors had "recognised the
OL,11,Fpositive culture within Woodlands".
